    contiguous buffer, its cacheable alias cleaned once, a write-combined mapping only) and the selectUtmi() sequence, re-written.
  package/PianoWifi/PianoWifi.cpp: cleanToPoc() (CTR_EL0 line size, dc civac), re-written.
  package/common/PianoIrq.h (sha256 ef924cd402caa63f5fe2a46dc2686c2672790f8187a830f13011ab2e6b085a60): included, not copied (SpiLine over
